3. THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
-------------------------

AILOFlow downloads and runs llama.cpp as its inference engine. llama.cpp is a
separate work by its own authors, distributed under the MIT License, and is not
covered by this licence. AILOFlow does not redistribute llama.cpp binaries: it
fetches them at runtime from the official releases.

Models downloaded through AILOFlow's catalog are covered by their own licences,
which the catalog displays for each entry. It is the user's responsibility to
comply with them.


